    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "小丽是一个时尚的女生，她特别喜欢穿漂亮的衣服。",
      "traditional": "小麗是一個時尚的女生，她特別喜歡穿漂亮的衣服。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lì shì yí ge shí shàng de nǚ shēng tā tè bié xǐ huan chuān piào liang de yī fu",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Xiao Li is a fashion girl. She really enjoys wearing beautiful clothes."
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "有一次，她在淘宝上买了一条很美的裙子。",
      "traditional": "有一次，她在淘寶上買了一條很美的裙子。",
      "pinyin": "yǒu yí cì tā zài táo bǎo shang mǎi le yì tiáo hěn měi de qún zi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "收到裙子后，她马上试了试，还拍了一张照片。",
      "traditional": "收到裙子後，她馬上試了試，還拍了一張照片。",
      "pinyin": "shōu dào qún zi hòu tā mǎ shàng shì le shì hái pāi le yì zhāng zhào piàn",
      "english": "One day, she bought a beautiful dress on Taobao."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "她对这件裙子很满意，在给淘宝卖家评价的时候，她也上传了那张照片。",
      "traditional": "她對這件裙子很滿意，在給淘寶賣家評價的時候，她也上傳了那張照片。",
      "pinyin": "tā duì zhè jiàn qún zi hěn mǎn yì zài gěi táo bǎo mài jiā píng jià de shí hou tā yě shàng chuán le nà zhāng zhào piàn",
      "english": "After receiving the dress she tried it on immediately and took a photo."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "She was so satisfied with the dress she wrote a review and at the same time uploaded the photo."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "后来她接到了好几个卖家打来的电话。",
      "traditional": "後來她接到了好幾個賣家打來的電話。",
      "pinyin": "hòu lái tā jiē dào le hǎo jǐ ge mài jiā dǎ lái de diàn huà",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "在电话中，卖家说：",
      "traditional": "在電話中，賣家說：",
      "pinyin": "zài diàn huà zhōng mài jiā shuō",
      "english": "After this she received several calls from the seller on Taobao."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "“请您把照片删了吧！如果别的客户看到了，他们就不会买我们的衣服了。”",
      "traditional": "“請您把照片刪了吧！如果別的客戶看到了，他們就不會買我們的衣服了。”",
      "pinyin": "qǐng nín bǎ zhào piàn shān le ba rú guǒ bié de kè hù kàn dào le tā men jiù bú huì mǎi wǒ men de yī fu le",
      "english": "On the phone the seller said:"
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "\"Please delete the photo! If other customers see it they will not buy any more clothes from us.\""
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小丽听了非常生气，她想：“我有那么丑吗？”",
      "traditional": "小麗聽了非常生氣，她想：“我有那麼醜嗎？”",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo lì tīng le fēi cháng shēng qì tā xiǎng wǒ yǒu nà me chǒu ma",
      "english": ""
    }
