    "sentence_translations": [
      "Am I that ugly?",
      "",
      "Xiao Li is a fashion girl. She really enjoys wearing beautiful clothes.",
      "",
      "One day, she bought a beautiful dress on Taobao.",
      "After receiving the dress she tried it on immediately and took a photo.",
      "She was so satisfied with the dress she wrote a review and at the same time uploaded the photo.",
      "",
      "After this she received several calls from the seller on Taobao.",
      "On the phone the seller said:",
      "\"Please delete the photo! If other customers see it they will not buy any more clothes from us.\"",
      "",
      "Xiao Li was very angry and she thought: \"Am I that ugly?\""
    ]
